  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 10th level, your potent swings allow you to hit your foes hard and fast.</p>\n<p>You can roll a d8 in place of the normal damage of your unarmed strikes. If you aren't wielding a weapon or a shield, you can roll a d10 instead.</p>\n<p>Once per turn, if you take the Attack action on your turn and have advantage on an attack roll, you can forgo the advantage for that roll to make an additional unarmed strike as part of the same action.</p>",
